<title>USA: Occidental Petroleum Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Occidental Petroleum Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.41     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net profit		159,000     loss	 7,000</p>
<p> Revs		    2,792,000		2,473,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  329,000		  318,800</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $1.77   profit	 $1.31</p>
