<p> Revs		   10,557,000	     10,423,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  324,100		  318,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr amounts are primary. Fully diluted shr is profit $0.40 vs loss $0.05 for Q4 and profit $1.73 vs profit $1.30 for year.</p>
<p>Year 1996 net includes extraordinary gain of $0.09/shr primary and $0.08/shr fully diluted.</p>
